  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studiebes&#xf6;k fr&#xe5;n KROATIEN</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit from Croatia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kroatiens myndighet f&#xf6;r pensionssystemreform, REGOS, fick bes&#xf6;k av svenska PPM i dec 2001. I maj 02 g&#xf6;r fyra personer fr&#xe5;n REGOS ett studiebes&#xf6;k hos PPM och andra svenska myndigheter i Stockholm som arbetar med pensionsf&#xf6;rs&#xe4;kringar, f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; st&#xf6;d i deras eget arbete.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REGOS in Croatia, in charge of the pension system reform, was visited by the Swedish PPM last December. In May 2002, REGOS are invited to a study tour to Stockholm, PPM and other offices working with the Swedish pension system, in order to get support in their own reform work at home.</narrative>
  </description>
